ENGLISH VERSION
========================================================================

1. Scope

This license covers everything in this repository (the catalog index,
the details pages, the apps' code and packages, the screenshots and the
documentation) and the container images of the apps published at
ghcr.io/rannden-sha (the "Apps").

The Apps are proprietary software of NextCode Agency. They are not free
or open source software: they are licensed, not sold. Being able to
download the code or the images publicly does not, by itself, grant any
right to use them.

2. Permitted use

You may install and use an App only:

  a) from the Hub365 app catalog, on a server with a valid Hub365
     license that includes that App, and while that license is in
     force; or
  b) under the terms of a written agreement with NextCode Agency.

Use is limited to the organization that holds the license and to its
own internal operations.

3. Restrictions

Unless NextCode Agency has given prior written permission, you may not:

  - copy, redistribute, publish, sell, rent, lend or sublicense the
    Apps, their code or their container images;
  - modify, translate or adapt them, or create derivative works;
  - decompile, disassemble or reverse engineer them, except to the
    extent the law expressly allows it despite this restriction;
  - use them without a Hub365 license that includes them, or bypass,
    disable or alter the license or identity checks;
  - remove or alter any ownership, trademark or license notices.

4. Third-party components

The Apps include third-party libraries and models that keep their own
licenses (for example MIT, BSD or Apache 2.0). This license does not
limit the rights those licenses give you over those components.

5. Warranty and liability

The Apps are provided "as is". To the extent permitted by law, NextCode
Agency is not liable for indirect damages, loss of profits or loss of
data arising from their use. Warranties and liability towards licensed
customers are those of their Hub365 contract or license.

6. Termination

The right to use an App ends when the Hub365 license that includes it
expires or is revoked, or if you breach this license. On termination you
must stop using the App. Your data is yours: you can export it or keep
the backups Hub365 makes.

7. Governing law

This license is governed by Spanish law. Unless the law sets a different
mandatory venue, the parties submit to the courts of NextCode Agency's
place of business.

To get an App, extend your license or ask about any other use:
info@nextcodeagency.com.
